  "regions": [
    {"id": "pfisic", "kind": "text", "text": "{.title}\n# Pad footing", "at": [0, 0]},
    {
      "id": "pfaymx",
      "kind": "text",
      "text": "Bearing pressure, sliding and overturning under service loads · allowable stress method",
      "at": [0, 36]
    },
    {
      "id": "pfsigv",
      "kind": "table",
      "header": {"column": true},
      "columns": [{"width": 104}, {"width": 206}],
      "rows": [
        ["Project", "Project name"],
        ["Client", "Client name"],
        ["Element", "Footing F1, column C1"],
        ["Prepared by", "A. Engineer"]
      ],
      "at": [0, 74]
    },
    {
      "id": "pfrhwb",
      "kind": "table",
      "header": {"column": true},
      "columns": [{"width": 104}, {"width": 206}],
      "rows": [
        ["Document no.", "CALC-GEO-006"],
        ["Revision", "A"],
        ["Date", "YYYY-MM-DD"],
        ["Checked by", "—"]
      ],
      "at": [328, 74]
    },
    {"id": "pfyivt", "kind": "toc", "of": "checks", "title": "Summary of checks", "at": [0, 195]},
    {"id": "pfuuib", "kind": "text", "text": "# Design basis", "at": [0, 353]},
    {
      "id": "pfgext",
      "kind": "text",
      "text": "Rectangular pad footing under a column, with characteristic (service) loads applied at ground level. The base pressure is linear, with no tension. The allowable bearing pressure and the base friction angle come from the site investigation; the factors of safety are the project's values, stated in [](#ref:pfqbxw). No code is used.",
      "at": [0, 401]
    },
    {"id": "pfqbxw", "kind": "text", "text": "# Data", "at": [0, 475]},
    {"id": "pfumjm", "kind": "math", "expr": "B:=2.0 m", "note": "width", "at": [0, 523]},
    {"id": "pfusus", "kind": "math", "expr": "L.f:=2.6 m", "note": "length, along M", "at": [220, 523]},
    {"id": "pfjxwk", "kind": "math", "expr": "h.f:=0.5 m", "note": "thickness", "at": [440, 523]},
    {"id": "pfabuk", "kind": "math", "expr": "D.f:=1.0 m", "note": "depth of the base", "at": [0, 560]},
    {"id": "pfrwgu", "kind": "math", "expr": "γ.c:=25 kN/m^3", "note": "concrete", "at": [220, 560]},
    {"id": "pfqsqp", "kind": "math", "expr": "γ.s:=18 kN/m^3", "note": "backfill", "at": [440, 560]},
    {"id": "pfrxyt", "kind": "math", "expr": "N.k:=600 kN", "note": "vertical", "at": [0, 600]},
    {"id": "pfwxdt", "kind": "math", "expr": "H.k:=40 kN", "note": "horizontal", "at": [220, 600]},
    {"id": "pfyfvv", "kind": "math", "expr": "M.k:=80 kN*m", "note": "moment", "at": [440, 600]},
    {"id": "pfhwgh", "kind": "math", "expr": "q.a:=200 kPa", "note": "gross allowable pressure", "at": [0, 637]},
    {"id": "pffjng", "kind": "math", "expr": "δ.b:=20 deg", "note": "base friction angle", "at": [330, 637]},
    {"id": "pfgsyx", "kind": "math", "expr": "FS.s:=1.5", "note": "sliding", "at": [0, 676]},
    {"id": "pfkprw", "kind": "math", "expr": "FS.o:=2.0", "note": "overturning", "at": [330, 676]},
    {"id": "pfuigp", "kind": "text", "text": "The column is at the centre of the footing; $`H.k` and $`M.k` act along $`L.f`.", "at": [0, 712]},
    {"id": "pftkft", "kind": "text", "text": "# Loads at the base", "at": [0, 749]},
    {
      "id": "pfmydn",
      "kind": "math",
      "expr": "W.f:=γ.c*B*L.f*h.f",
      "show": "value",
      "display": {"unit": "kN", "decimals": 1},
      "note": "footing",
      "at": [0, 797]
    },
    {
      "id": "pfhajs",
      "kind": "math",
      "expr": "W.s:=γ.s*B*L.f*(D.f-h.f)",
      "show": "value",
      "display": {"unit": "kN", "decimals": 1},
      "note": "soil on the footing",
      "at": [0, 834]
    },
    {"id": "pfnasd", "kind": "math", "expr": "N.b:=N.k+W.f+W.s", "show": "value", "display": {"unit": "kN", "decimals": 1}, "at": [0, 870]},
    {
      "id": "pfpktc",
      "kind": "math",
      "expr": "M.b:=M.k+H.k*D.f",
      "show": "value",
      "display": {"unit": "kN*m", "decimals": 1},
      "note": "moment about the base",
      "at": [0, 906]
    },
    {
      "id": "pfdhzx",
      "kind": "math",
      "expr": "e.b:=M.b/N.b",
      "show": "value",
      "display": {"unit": "m", "decimals": 3},
      "note": "eccentricity",
      "at": [0, 942]
    },
    {"id": "pfyjyz", "kind": "text", "text": "# Bearing pressure", "at": [0, 991]},
    {"id": "pfrdke", "kind": "math", "expr": "q.avg:=N.b/(B*L.f)", "show": "value", "display": {"unit": "kPa", "decimals": 1}, "at": [0, 1039]},
    {"id": "pfxezh", "kind": "math", "expr": "e.b<=L.f/6", "note": "middle third: full contact", "at": [330, 1039]},
    {
      "id": "pfykxe",
      "kind": "math",
      "expr": "q.tri:=if(e.b<L.f/2, 2*N.b/(3*B*(L.f/2-e.b)), error(\"the resultant is outside the base\"))",
      "at": [0, 1088]
    },
    {
      "id": "pfekpz",
      "kind": "math",
      "expr": "q.max:=if(e.b<=L.f/6, q.avg*(1+6*e.b/L.f), q.tri)",
      "show": "value",
      "display": {"unit": "kPa", "decimals": 1},
      "at": [0, 1164]
    },
    {
      "id": "pfvpek",
      "kind": "math",
      "expr": "q.min:=if(e.b<=L.f/6, q.avg*(1-6*e.b/L.f), 0 kPa)",
      "show": "value",
      "display": {"unit": "kPa", "decimals": 1},
      "at": [0, 1215]
    },
    {"id": "pfxiqf", "kind": "math", "expr": "q.max<=q.a", "note": "bearing pressure", "at": [0, 1266]},
    {
      "id": "pfcqai",
      "kind": "text",
      "text": "Outside the middle third the pressure is triangular, peaking at $`q.tri`; see [](#ref:pfyzcz) and [](#ref:pfvcma).",
      "at": [0, 1303]
    },
    {
      "id": "pfmrxe",
      "kind": "math",
      "expr": "q(x):=if(e.b<=L.f/6, q.avg*(1+12*e.b*x/L.f^2), max(q.max*(1-(L.f/2-x)/(3*(L.f/2-e.b))), 0 kPa))",
      "at": [0, 1339]
    },
    {
      "id": "pfyzcz",
      "kind": "plot2d",
      "size": [310, 180],
      "series": [{"y": "q(x)", "x": "x", "range": "-L.f/2..L.f/2", "label": "q"}],
      "axes": {"x": {"unit": "m", "label": "x"}, "y": {"unit": "kPa", "label": "q", "min": 0}},
      "grid": true,
      "extrema": true,
      "caption": {"text": "Bearing pressure along the footing"},
      "at": [0, 1415]
    },
    {
      "id": "pfvcma",
      "kind": "plot3d",
      "size": [310, 250],
      "series": [{"surface": "q(x)", "xrange": "-L.f/2..L.f/2", "yrange": "-B/2..B/2", "label": "q"}],
      "axes": {"x": {"unit": "m"}, "y": {"unit": "m"}, "z": {"unit": "kPa", "label": "q"}},
      "camera": {"azimuth": -55, "elevation": 25, "distance": 3.4},
      "caption": {"text": "Bearing pressure under the base"},
      "at": [332, 1415]
    },
    {"id": "pfwpwz", "kind": "text", "text": "# Sliding and overturning", "at": [0, 1708]},
    {
      "id": "pfkgwf",
      "kind": "math",
      "expr": "R.s:=N.b*tan(δ.b)",
      "show": "value",
      "display": {"unit": "kN", "decimals": 1},
      "note": "base friction",
      "at": [0, 1756]
    },
    {
      "id": "pftgfv",
      "kind": "math",
      "expr": "M.r:=N.b*L.f/2",
      "show": "value",
      "display": {"unit": "kN*m", "decimals": 1},
      "note": "about the toe",
      "at": [330, 1756]
    },
    {"id": "pfvpbx", "kind": "math", "expr": "F.s:=R.s/H.k", "show": "value", "display": {"decimals": 2}, "at": [0, 1805]},
    {"id": "pfcbqt", "kind": "math", "expr": "F.o:=M.r/M.b", "show": "value", "display": {"decimals": 2}, "at": [330, 1805]},
    {"id": "pftsus", "kind": "math", "expr": "F.s>=FS.s", "note": "sliding", "at": [0, 1853]},
    {"id": "pfdpbc", "kind": "math", "expr": "F.o>=FS.o", "note": "overturning", "at": [330, 1853]}
  ]
}
